# KTC cache. directory.json is today's snapshot; players/<name_id>.json
# is per-player full history (back to 2021). Reproducible from dynasty-daddy
# and accumulates to ~1k files — not worth committing.
data/ktc_cache/

# Python bytecode caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Built every run and uploaded with the LOTG_outputs artifact, but NOT committed.
# It is a zip of the CSVs sitting beside it — the same bytes twice — and being
# already-compressed, git can neither zlib nor delta it: every rebuild stored a
# fresh ~9.4 MB blob. Measured 2026-09-08, it was 122 MB of a 210 MB repo, 58% of
# everything, for data the repo already had. The CSVs are the source of truth;
# grab the zip from the run artifact when you want one file.
exports/LOTG_Exports.zip
